Package: ateratxrs
Title: Rust Decoder for Atera Transcript Archives
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Ruben", "Dries", , "rdries@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prototype Rust backend that streams an Atera v1
    'transcripts.zarr.zip' archive into tiled parquet, in the layout of
    GiottoDisk's point tile store. Decodes grid cells on threads within one
    process instead of one forked R session each.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.65.0, xz
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Suggests:
    arrow,
    GiottoDisk
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
